{"3356310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "sheeeroom", "steam_appid": 3356310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;sheeeroom&quot;</strong> is a mysterious adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356310/extras/35bdc720a0ad62290ec1a599fb3b19d7.avif?t=1761520936\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have come to this place to retrieve something precious that was lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To do so, you wish to bring &quot;She&quot; back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the various puzzles prepared for you and gather what &quot;She&quot; needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even you don’t know what &quot;She&quot; truly is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you have no choice—you must do it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356310/extras/0e711dde39cf06f296bd0fdc7850faef.avif?t=1761520936\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A walking simulator where various events unfold as you move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress the story by investigating objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No quest markers or time limits—play at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;She&quot; is always glowing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime:</strong> 15–60 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Video Streaming Guidelines</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming is allowed without prior permission, whether by individuals or organizations.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": 